"서모스타트·고온경보에 의한 특별작동<br>또는 <b>열림 개시온도</b>가 되었을 때":{en:"Special operation by the thermostat or the high-temperature alarm,<br>or when the <b>opening start temperature</b> is reached"},
"빗물감지에 의한 특별작동<br>또는 <b>닫힘 개시온도</b>가 되었을 때":{en:"Special operation by rain detection,<br>or when the <b>closing start temperature</b> is reached"},
